# Baron Helmut Zemo: "You may cast up to three of the copies" - none is a legal answer. Bot1 exiles the Excruciator, Pox Plague and
# Griselbrand (see the first boast scenario for the setup) and declines to cast any copy: the copies cease to exist (CR 707.10a)
# with nothing cast, so nothing is on the stack or the battlefield, the three original cards stay in exile (CR 400.7) and the
# graveyard keeps the rest. The boast's cost was paid all the same.

